{"unit_id":"hansjone__netxops#card-zh","repo":"hansjone/netxops","commit":"fb94c8a6a077678655b226a0228a8f2729044965","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-netxops 是面向 DeepSeek Harness Web 的网络运维与监控插件，通过设置页连接 Netx 服务，并把选定的工具组和技能挂载到 Netx Ops 或其他预设。它提供网络运维、业务监控和拓扑工具，支持配置告警推送到 DSH 会话或 IM、使用本地知识库工具，以及将可读取的持久会话导出为 ZIP。适合需要在 Harness 中调用网络管理能力、整理运维知识或汇总会话日志的团队。需要可访问的 Netx API 服务及 NETX_API_TOKEN；IM 与定时投递需另装对应插件。","source":"generated","evidence":["package.json:1","cordis.bundle.patch.yml:5-16","lib/agent-tools-topology.js:2029-2065","src/netx/session-export.ts:215-260"]}
{"unit_id":"hansjone__netxops#card-en","repo":"hansjone/netxops","commit":"fb94c8a6a077678655b226a0228a8f2729044965","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-netxops connects Harness Web to a Netx service and mounts selected tools in presets. It provides network operations, monitoring, topology, alarm delivery, local knowledge tools, and ZIP session export. A reachable Netx API and NETX_API_TOKEN are required; IM delivery needs a separate plugin.","source":"generated","evidence":["package.json:1","cordis.bundle.patch.yml:5-16","lib/agent-tools-topology.js:2029-2065","src/netx/session-export.ts:215-260"]}
