{"unit_id":"hansjone__netxops#feature-1","repo":"hansjone/netxops","commit":"fb94c8a6a077678655b226a8a8f2729044965","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-netxops 的功能「按组挂载远程工具」：从 Netx MCP 目录筛选已启用的网络运维、业务监控或拓扑工具，并注册到 Harness 工具接口；工具调用转发到配置的 Netx 服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/agent-tools-topology.js:1993-2027","lib/agent-tools-topology.js:2029-2065"]}
{"unit_id":"hansjone__netxops#feature-2","repo":"hansjone/netxops","commit":"fb94c8a6a077678655b226a8a8f2729044965","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-netxops 的功能「告警分发」：启用后可将网络告警送到 DSH 会话和所选 IM 目标，两个投递通道并行处理，单个通道失败不会取消另一通道。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/netx/alarm-dispatch.ts:28-53"]}
{"unit_id":"hansjone__netxops#feature-3","repo":"hansjone/netxops","commit":"fb94c8a6a077678655b226a8a8f2729044965","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-netxops 的功能「会话 ZIP 导出」：从支持原始产物的持久化后端读取会话记录，将清单和会话文件打包为 ZIP，供用户下载；不支持原始产物的后端无法使用此导出。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/netx/session-export.ts:125-164","src/netx/session-export.ts:215-260"]}
{"unit_id":"hansjone__netxops#caveat-1","repo":"hansjone/netxops","commit":"fb94c8a6a077678655b226a8a8f2729044965","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"使用前须知：远程工具连接 Netx API（默认本机 127.0.0.1:8890），并使用 NETX_API_TOKEN；IM 和定时投递需另装插件。（见 cordis.bundle.patch.yml:10-16,27-32）","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.bundle.patch.yml:10-16","cordis.bundle.patch.yml:27-32","lib/agent-tools-topology.js:2003-2016"]}
